{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把“连过去开心的事都不敢多想”理解成“不愿否认那些快乐的回忆”。原意是回忆美好也会让他难受，因此不敢多想，并不是不愿意否认或承认那些回忆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"漏掉了“可他怕还要等很久，才能遇上亲近的人”这一层对漫长等待的担忧。另外，把“即使一直没有”弱化成了“即使暂时没有”，改变了他对可能长期缺少亲近关系的接受程度。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 3,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线和人物心理变化基本一致，但结尾把“即使一直没有亲近的人”弱化为“暂时没有”，也把“不再为留人咽委屈”偏向解释成不愿为了摆脱孤单而委屈自己，整体方向正确，结尾的决心和时间尺度略有偏差。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "28c4f493-52af-4032-b032-ba90709fa0ac", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T165208383123Z", "elapsed_seconds": 99.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T16:53:47.579873+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_train